    <string name="contribute_mine">My contributions</string>
    <string name="contribute_consent_title">Contribute scans</string>
    <string name="contribute_consent_body">When you confirm a scanned card (added automatically, or confirmed in Review), the app uploads the cropped picture of that card together with the card id and the card\'s language. Nothing else: no location, no device or account data, and the picture is saved without any metadata.\n\nYou release these pictures into the public domain under CC0 1.0 (creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0). Anyone may use them for any purpose, including training recognition models, without credit.\n\nYou can withdraw a picture or all of them at any time under My contributions. A withdrawn picture is deleted from the server right away and left out of every future dataset release. Releases already published keep it, because copies of them can\'t be called back.\n\nScans waiting for a connection are sent later. Turning this off deletes the ones not sent yet.</string>
